{"n":4,"lines":[[73.79,628.79,107.29,"Marcellus",400,0,9.5,"#ffffff","FEELFULLYYOU.COM "],[43.21,625.93,5.79,"Bodoni",700,1,8.77,"#000000","4"],[36.44,233.96,362.45,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","The sensation of feeling free, vibrant and alive with a keen connection to my body, emotions and nature. "],[36.44,244.96,352.54,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","I lay on the damp grass, feeling the earth underneath me, supporting me. The scent of flowers wafted "],[36.44,255.95,361.49,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","by as I enjoyed the summer sun on my shoulders, a slight breeze ruffling my hair. Moments of complete "],[36.44,266.95,354.44,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","oneness, where thoughts and emotions would come in and out, and cherishing the moments of being "],[36.44,277.95,66.35,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","alone with what is. "],[159.88,59.52,112.22,"Marcellus",400,0,16.0,"#231f20","P R E F A C E"],[75.11,157.96,291.98,"Jost",500,0,9.5,"#231f20","S C R U M P T I O U S N E S S ,  S E N S U A L I T Y  A N D  T H E  L I F E  "],[81.46,174.53,279.29,"Jost",500,0,9.5,"#231f20","F O R C E  R U N N I N G  T H R O U G H  U S  H AV E  A LWAY S  "],[121.48,191.1,189.93,"Jost",500,0,9.5,"#231f20","B E E N  V E R Y  P O T E N T  I N  M Y  L I F E ."],[36.44,309.39,103.86,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","I want you to know that even if "],[36.44,320.38,98.24,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","this was not your experience "],[36.44,331.38,102.53,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","growing up, and that you may "],[36.44,342.38,92.87,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","not be able to concur up a "],[36.44,353.37,87.25,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","memory like that, you are "],[36.44,364.37,93.5,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","exactly at the place you are "],[36.44,375.37,58.72,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","meant to be now!"],[36.44,392.04,98.83,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","There is a reason you chose "],[36.44,403.03,85.44,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","this book and this time—"],[36.44,419.7,59.88,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","A time to PAUSE "],[36.44,436.38,82.94,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","A time to come back to "],[36.44,447.37,47.76,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","yourself fully. "],[36.44,464.04,53.47,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","A time to FEEL."],[36.44,480.71,103.13,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","A time to notice your energy. "],[36.44,497.38,92.83,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","I would like you to imagine "],[36.44,508.38,94.8,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","what it would feel like to be "],[36.44,519.37,99.83,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","fully aware of your emotions, "],[36.44,530.37,84.71,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","your senses, and what is "],[36.44,541.37,85.7,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","happening in your body. "],[162.89,309.35,105.15,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","This may be discombobulating "],[162.89,320.34,95.44,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","at first, yet it is a practice of "],[162.89,331.34,98.94,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","TRUST in YOURSELF! Believe "],[162.89,342.34,83.17,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","that you are able to trust "],[162.89,353.33,87.13,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","yourself to be in constant "],[162.89,364.33,86.29,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","communication with your "],[162.89,375.32,94.35,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","scrumptiousness and body, "],[162.89,386.32,102.96,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","slowing down enough to hear "],[162.89,397.32,51.46,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","the whispers... "],[162.89,408.31,99.07,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","They do not have to become "],[162.89,419.31,91.55,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","screams, and I learned the "],[162.89,430.3,39.26,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","hard way... "],[162.89,446.98,96.08,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","We often forget to tune into "],[162.89,457.97,99.17,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","our own needs and continue "],[162.89,468.97,82.91,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","on regardless of what is "],[162.89,479.96,96.37,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","happening inside us. This is "],[162.89,490.96,101.9,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","a journey of discovering what "],[162.89,501.96,99.85,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","truly lights you up so that this "],[162.89,512.95,88.33,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","becomes the compass by "],[162.89,523.95,103.85,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","which you navigate your days. "],[162.89,534.94,103.68,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","The feeling of being so utterly "],[162.89,545.94,91.54,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","comfortable and confident "],[289.78,309.27,99.7,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","in WHO you are and how this "],[289.78,320.27,108.32,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","radiates out to those around you. "],[289.78,331.26,94.48,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","This REMEMBERING of your "],[289.77,342.26,100.33,"Jost",600,0,8.2,"#000000","TRUE SCRUMPTIOUSNESS"],[390.1,342.26,2.34,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","!"],[289.77,358.93,98.48,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","The Scrumptiousness Journal "],[289.77,369.93,104.31,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","was created to encourage you "],[289.77,380.93,101.86,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","to reflect on your life and use "],[289.77,391.92,53.37,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","that awareness! "],[289.77,408.59,94.46,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","By Scrumptiousness, I mean "],[289.77,419.59,105.88,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","the life force, the chi, the prana "],[289.77,430.58,100.7,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","that moves through us, having "],[289.77,441.58,100.7,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","us feel fully alive. For some of "],[289.77,452.58,102.27,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","you, this may feel like a distant "],[289.77,463.57,100.18,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","memory; others may be more "],[289.77,474.57,86.41,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","intimately connected to it. "],[289.77,485.57,104.3,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","Become intimate with the most "],[289.77,496.56,100.29,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","important person in your life: "],[289.77,507.56,40.73,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","YOURSELF! "],[289.77,524.23,105.35,"Jost",400,0,8.2,"#231f20","This is your chance to (re) start 